WEBVTT

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.120
Nagisa! Shoot!

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.010
I don't believe it!

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.410
Nagisa!

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.010
You didn't follow through!

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.550
Don't let it get to you, Nagisa.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.290
Hurry, and get back here!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.150
Defense! Run!

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.910
But that guy could have finished us off,

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.490
so why did he say he'll be back?

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.680
What are we supposed to do 
if that guy appears again?

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.570
I don't have any energy left.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:01.830
I can't do this.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.940
Nagisa! As punishment for missing the shot...

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.550
You have to run to the training camp.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.280
We're taking the long way around!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.340
Just me?

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.630
Let's go!

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.950
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.590
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:25.860
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.830
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.700
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:33.600
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.110
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:44.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:50.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.790
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.360
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.530
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.400
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:09.670
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:10.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.980
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:20.550
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:23.620
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.940
Don't worry.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:35.460
I know where all the Prism Stones are.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:40.290
The eternal life of Dotsuku 
Zone will soon be complete.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.200
Ilkubo...

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:42.880
Yes?

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:44.400
Don't underestimate...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.900
...the light.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.620
Go!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:56.190
"DANGER! 
THE SUMMER TRAINING CAMP NIGHTMARE"

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:01.180
Don't slow down!

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.850
But...

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.880
The air feels so good.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.110
Look at that, Nagisa...

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.770
The lake is so beautiful.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:17.460
I don't have any energy left to look...

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.730
But it really is beautiful!

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:26.090
Hey! Who said you could stop?

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:32.100
The air is fresh and the water is clear!

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.420
It feels so good, doesn't it?

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.050
It's the feel of the great outdoors.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.230
We should be grateful to the mountain gods.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.030
I didn't know you were such 
a romanticist, Yuriko.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.350
What do you mean by that?

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:52.380
But why does the principal have to come 
to the science club training camp?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.040
He said he wants to commune with nature 
along with the students once in a while.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.910
He doesn't fit in...

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:03.060
Don't you have a nasty feeling 
that he'll just hold us back?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.580
That's not nice!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.220
I'm drowning! Somebody help me!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.850
Hurry!

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:18.080
I was just showing you a bad example.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:21.100
Be careful that this doesn't happen to you.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.310
Principal! It's bad for your health 
to stay in your wet clothes.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.760
I'll bring you a towel.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.060
Good job!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.530
I'm going ahead to take a shower.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.220
Ogre!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.680
Nagisa!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.140
Later! I can't take another step.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:54.110
Snake...

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.850
Snake! Where? Where's the 
snake? I hate snakes!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.850
See? You can move mepo.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.020
That's not funny!

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.120
You'd better think about the 
time and place for your jokes,

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.890
or you're going to regret it!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:07.870
Nagisa!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.590
What are you doing here, Honoka?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:16.520
I told you that our training 
camps were going to overlap!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.110
That's right. You did, didn't you?

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.030
I've been practicing so hard that 
I completely forgot about it.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.300
How's Akane-san doing as a temporary coach?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.260
She's the best!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.610
Before dinner, the principal 
has a few words for you.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.240
Go ahead, Principal...

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.710
No... As the person in charge 
of the summer training camp,

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.090
you should be the one, Vice Principal.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:45.580
No.. no... You should be the one, Principal.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.500
No... no...

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:49.960
Never mind! Just do it!

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:50.940
All right...

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.780
Lights out at 10 p.m.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.930
Don't get carried away just because 
this is a summer training camp.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:01.470
Please don't forget that what you 
do will reflect on Verone Academy.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:05.270
This is a place where you learn the 
rules of living in a group situation,

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.280
so just as you would in school,

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:13.320
we expect you all to show 
self-restraint while you are here.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.400
For you information, you 
will get up at 6 a.m.,

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.410
have your various meetings, 
and after morning practice,

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.290
breakfast will be at 7:30.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.640
What do you think?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.570
What do you mean?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.610
Isn't this great? I just love high places.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:37.150
Just be careful that you don't fall down.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.160
How did you know that I 
roll around in my sleep?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.210
Yuriko?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.640
Look!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.170
I've never seen a star-filled 
sky like this before.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.580
You're right.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:55.460
It doesn't look like the same 
stars we look up at all the time.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.830
A shooting star!

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:00.540
A shooting star?

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:03.180
That's right. Make a wish... A wish...

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.230
Come to think of it...

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.620
What's wrong, Nagisa?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.340
Nothing...

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.830
The stars are beautiful, aren't they?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.610
We just saw shooting star.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.780
We all made a wish.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:33.570
But this place has the divine flavor 
of the god that protects the mountains.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.770
A god that protects the mountains?

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:39.630
There has always been a god that 
protects the mountains here,

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:43.090
so if you break a branch without 
permission, the gods will punish you.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:49.680
It's probably someone who wanted to 
preserve nature who came up with that...

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:50.780
Alright!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.050
I'm going to make a wish to the 
god who protects the mountains.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.230
What are you going to wish for?

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:01.920
For now, I'll just pray that I can 
wake up at six tomorrow morning.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.460
Have any of you seen Shiho?

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:10.040
I've been looking for her all 
this time, but I can't find her.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.090
You were together at dinner, weren't you?

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.670
After that, we went back 
to the room together,

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.330
but she suddenly disappeared.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:22.000
Maybe she was spirited away by the gods.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:23.660
Spirited away by the gods?

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:25.860
That couldn't be!

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:29.760
The gods wouldn't get angry unless 
you do something wrong, would they?

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:35.280
It's not time for lights out, is it?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.990
Then, you think it's the mountain god...?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.680
Quiet down!

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.000
We're checking into the cause 
of the power failure right now...

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.760
Quiet down, all of you!

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:50.200
Is it true that Shiho is missing, Rina?

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.560
It looks like she's been 
spirited away by the gods.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:55.090
What are you saying?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.850
Let's all split up, and look for her.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.960
Shiho!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.570
Where are you, Shiho?

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.150
Shiho!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:10.420
I'll share some chocolate cake 
with you, so hurry, and come out!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.340
Can you tell what's wrong?

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.010
Please move it a little more to the right.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.060
This way...?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.200
How aggravating! Give it to me!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.930
No... I can't have you doing 
something like this, Principal.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:25.810
Just give it to me.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.490
No, I'll do it.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.590
Give it to me!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.610
How's this?

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:33.720
I found it!

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:35.780
Shiho!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.390
Shiho...

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.390
The lights went on.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.760
Let's go back for now.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.550
Vice Principal!

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:49.270
The breaker was just turned off.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.460
Isn't that right, Principal?

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.530
We could have solved the problem sooner 
if you weren't here, Vice Principal.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.910
How did the search go?

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:02.150
Where could Shiho have gone?

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.070
I stayed in too long. I'm feeling so dizzy.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:08.060
Shiho!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:11.900
I was in the bath when the lights went out.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.290
I was going to stay in until 
the lights went on again,

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.680
but I couldn't take it any longer.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.660
But... but... It was so 
dark that I had a hard...

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.560
hard... hard time putting my clothes back on.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.720
I really did.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.780
Shiho!

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:28.240
What?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.210
Your sweatshirt is on backwards.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.850
Why didn't I realize that?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.400
Lights out at 10 p.m.!

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.480
Get ready for bed!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:21.640
We had another power failure this morning.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.920
Maybe it's the mountain god at work...

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:30.310
Don't say strange things like 
that so early in the morning.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.980
Nagisa! Don't stop all of a sudden like that.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:40.220
What is it?

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.050
Over there.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.560
Hey! Why did you all stop?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.370
Look over there, Akane-san.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.660
It was full of water yesterday...

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.810
It's totally dry, and parched.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:05.400
Why are the leaves red when it's summer?

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:08.720
You're right!

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.420
They're all bright red.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.850
What's going on, Akane-san?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.580
Why ask me...?

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.550
Don't you think it's the 
mountain god, after all?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:21.320
There aren't such curses like 
that in this day and age.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.240
Isn't all these leaves 
falling a little scary?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.160
What's going on, Principal...?

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.140
Why ask me...?

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.950
What do you think Yukishiro-san?

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:02.890
It's not this... how about this one?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:26.480
The dried out trees are 
falling one after another.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.010
They're blocking off the roads.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.690
Maybe it's a warning sign of an earthquake.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.510
Let's get off the mountain 
while it's still light.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.890
All right. Vice Principal... 
Call for outsider help.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:40.310
The cell phones don't work.

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:42.330
There's a phone in the lobby, isn't there?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.470
That's right! I forgot.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.490
Principal! The phone doesn't work!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.910
That's not possible!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:56.200
Hello! Hello?

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.360
It really doesn't work, does it?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.550
Does that mean we're isolated 
from the rest of the world?

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.050
Nagisa...

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:07.950
What do you think?

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:11.190
You mean why the mountain god is angry...?

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.710
Even if there were such a 
thing as a mountain god,

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:15.630
there's no reason for the god to be angry!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.600
Then what does it mean?

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:23.890
The strange change in the weather 
isn't the work of the mountain god...

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.640
Don't tell me...?

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.250
Honoka's right mepo!

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:35.210
I feel a strong energy really close by mepo!

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:37.180
I feel it, too mipo!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.020
I have an awful feeling about this mipo!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.840
It's close mepo. It's close mepo.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.940
It's getting closer and closer mipo!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.220
It's getting closer mepo!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.860
The lake mepo!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.860
The lake mipo!

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:13.050
You're...

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.490
Why are you doing this?

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.260
Say something!

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.380
Hurry, and transform.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:32.600
What do you mean?

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.530
I'm telling you to transform.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.110
Are you afraid?

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.020
What are you saying?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.900
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:16.410
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.160
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.030
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.430
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.860
Go back to where you came from!

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.170
So that's it, after all.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.460
What is it?

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.320
What have you been talking about anyway?

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:38.300
Oh, no! Don't tell me...!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.880
It can't be! It just can't be mipo!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:43.110
What's going on?

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.670
Wisdom... In other words,

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.950
I've figured out where the 
Stone Keeper is hiding.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.200
He was after the Keeper to begin with mepo!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.170
He might have figured out where he his mipo!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.290
How could he...?

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.640
You are all guardians of the Prism Stones,

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:06.130
so whenever you transform, Wisdom will react.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:11.600
And I am able to sense even 
the slightest movement...

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:16.180
We won't let you have the Prism 
Stones or the Stone Keeper.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:20.090
I'll show you that you can't protect 
anything with just feelings alone.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:29.730
Black!

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.300
White!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.570
I'm okay.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.780
What's wrong? Is that it?

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:02.890
White!

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:10.560
Black!

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.270
Black!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:37.460
It's time I take the stones...

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.420
I won't let you have them...

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:49.690
You'll never get the Prism Stones!

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:53.440
I don't know how strong you are,

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:58.460
but if you think you can do anything 
you want just because you're strong...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.760
You're greatly mistaken!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:05.470
You're both under a huge misconception!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.520
Misconception?

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:12.990
